        :class:`~sage.libs.singular.option.LibSingularOptions`.
    
        Note that Groebner bases over `\ZZ` can also be computed. ::
    
            sage: P.<a,b,c> = PolynomialRing(ZZ,3)
            sage: I = P * (a + 2*b + 2*c - 1, a^2 - a + 2*b^2 + 2*c^2, 2*a*b + 2*b*c - b)
